      "content": "That's a pretty intense start—it definitely captures that specific era's tone. The students might struggle with the \"why\" behind it though. Can you expand on the specific arguments a person in that position would make regarding the \"necessity\" of European law and commerce over existing local structures? Just keep it in that same historical voice so they can really get into the mindset of the administrator explaining his \"moral duty.\"",
